  "goodToKnow": "Anheben means to lift something slightly (den Tisch anheben) and to raise prices, taxes or rates: die Mehrwertsteuer anheben, das Rentenalter anheben. Germany's minimum wage was angehoben (raised) to €12 in 2022 and has risen further since. Die Anhebung is an increase. The opposite is senken. Separable and irregular: hob an, angehoben."
